      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Titus Lartius, having set a guard upon Corioles, going with drum and trumpet toward Cominius and Caius Martius, enters with a Lieutenant, other Soldiers, and a Scout.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
